  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nPRIME LARGE RESIDENTIAL SITE\nTULSK, CO. ROSCOMMON\n\nWALKING DISTANCE OF TULSK VILLAGE\n\nSOLD SUBJECT TO PLANNING PERMISSION\n\nASKING PRICE: €60,000\n\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this prime large residential site, superbly positioned within walking distance of the heart of Tulsk Village.\n\nOccupying a prominent position with excellent road frontage, this is a particularly attractive opportunity for anyone wishing to build their own home while enjoying the convenience of village living.\n\nThe site benefits from a footpath and street lighting immediately adjacent, providing safe and convenient pedestrian access into Tulsk.\n\nA significant advantage of the property is its connection to the public sewer system, with other essential services available in the vicinity.\n\nThe site is being offered for sale subject to the purchaser obtaining planning permission for a dwelling house.\n\n\nLOCATION\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent location within easy walking distance of Tulsk Village and its wide range of local services and amenities, including:\n\n• Local school\n• Church\n• Shops and filling station\n• Pubs\n• Sporting and community facilities\n• Everyday village amenities\n\nTulsk also enjoys an excellent central location within County Roscommon, making this an attractive option for those looking to build a family home with the benefits of village amenities close at hand.\n\n\nGENERAL FEATURES\n\n• Prime large residential site\n• Walking distance of Tulsk Village\n• Prominent position with excellent road frontage\n• Connected to the public sewer system\n• Footpath immediately adjacent\n• Street lighting\n• Services available nearby\n• Convenient to school, church, shops and local amenities\n• Sold subject to planning permission\n• Excellent opportunity for a one-off family home\n\n\nASKING PRICE\n\n€60,000\n\n\nVIEWING\n\nSites of this quality and convenience within walking distance of Tulsk Village rarely come to the market.\n\nImmediate enquiries are advised.\n\nFor maps, further particulars or to arrange an inspection, contact the Sole Selling Agents:\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel: 086 213 0723\n\nOffice: 094 936 2216\n\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\n\nDISCLAIMER\n\nThese particulars, including site boundaries, measurements, distances, services and descriptions, are provided for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. The sale is subject to the purchaser obtaining the necessary planning permission. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves regarding planning, services, boundaries and all other matters relating to the proposed development.",
